      "writtenOn": "2020-11-25T00:39:46Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "But with this fix, the caller may have gone unnoticed correct? It kind of feels like we\u0027re papering over a subset of failures; I ideally we\u0027d have the assertion catch it. I wonder if perhaps we could have unit tests run with and without `CONFIG_DEBUG_BRINGUP` enabled. Better still, if we ever get to a point where we\u0027re running nightly testing with actual hardware, flash the two builds on DUTs for better coverage.",
      "range": {
