      "writtenOn": "2020-11-25T02:36:56Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "The alternative might be to remove the CONFIG_DEBUG_BRINGUP guard and always enable the assertion. I don\u0027t expect that would be any more expensive performance-wise than the current conditional, but it would have a small additional cost in code size.\n\nOtherwise it sounds like there\u0027s follow-up work to be done in investigating ways the testing could be improved, right?",
      "parentUuid": "8be14fc3_d6984d56",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 15,
