      "writtenOn": "2020-11-25T07:43:37Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Indeed, unconditionally enabling the assertion seems a better trade-off.\nWe would detect 100% of the bad cases and as you mentioned, it\u0027s not costing more than your previous solution.",
      "parentUuid": "8618b0e8_c7d5c1b9",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 15,
